{"id":"hse9wzc9x8q0gbysmztx9ikea","title":"魔法集换式卡片游戏中的指数级行为","originalTitle":"Exponential Behavior in Magic: The Gathering","summary":"作者开发了一个名为 Arcana 的规则引擎，旨在改进魔法集换式卡片游戏（MTG）的人工智能玩法。Scute Swarm 卡牌因其指数级增长特性而闻名，作者通过构建复杂的卡组组合展示了这一特性带来的巨大计算复杂度。使用六张地牌时，Scute Swarm 可以迅速复制成数千张，带来数万点生命值的增长，揭示了游戏中指数级行为的挑战。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://levineuwirth.org/essays/exponential-magic/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T14:07:09.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T12:36:41.296Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T12:36:41.296Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["新项目","技术方案","GitHub"],"score":49,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"5dce849d-5937-475b-93e1-1a828900c01d","title":"MTG卡牌Scute Swarm暴露指数级计算复杂性"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"5dce849d-5937-475b-93e1-1a828900c01d","title":"MTG卡牌Scute Swarm暴露指数级计算复杂性"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f0iM1iX_lKkU","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}